/*!
\page page_stFmsCluster StFmsCluster

\brief Reconstructed cluster of adjacent FMS lead-glass towers.

\section fmsCluster_overview Overview

StFmsCluster represents a group of adjacent FMS lead-glass towers sharing
energy from one or more particles (2.5 < η < 4.0).  The class stores total
energy (0th moment), centroid position in local grid units (1st moment),
2nd-moment shape parameters, chi2 quality of 1- and 2-photon shower profile
fits, and the reconstructed four-momentum.  Non-owning references link it to
constituent StFmsHit tower objects and fitted StFmsPoint photon points.

\section fmsCluster_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StFmsCluster
\endcode

Stored in \ref page_stFmsCollection "StFmsCollection".

\section fmsCluster_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|---|---|---|
| UShort_t | mDetectorId | 8=NLarge, 9=SLarge, 10=NSmall, 11=SSmall. |
| Int_t | mCategory | Category: 1-photon, 2-photon, etc. |
| Int_t | mNTowers | Number of contributing towers. |
| Float_t | mEnergy | Total energy [GeV]. |
| Float_t | mX | x centroid in local grid units. |
| Float_t | mY | y centroid in local grid units. |
| Float_t | mSigmaMin | Minor-axis 2nd moment. |
| Float_t | mSigmaMax | Major-axis 2nd moment. |
| Float_t | mChi2Ndf1Photon | χ²/ndf for 1-photon fit. |
| Float_t | mChi2Ndf2Photon | χ²/ndf for 2-photon fit. |
| Int_t | mId | Event-wide cluster ID. |
| StLorentzVectorF | mFourMomentum | Cluster four-momentum. |
| StPtrVecFmsPoint | mPhotons | Fitted photon points (non-owning). |
| StPtrVecFmsHit | mHits | Constituent hits (non-owning). |

\section fmsCluster_methods Key Methods

- \c detectorId() — sub-detector ID.
- \c category(), \c nTowers(), \c nPhotons() — classification.
- \c energy(), \c x(), \c y() — energy and centroid.
- \c sigmaMin(), \c sigmaMax() — shower shape.
- \c chi2Ndf1Photon(), \c chi2Ndf2Photon() — fit quality.
- \c id(), \c fourMomentum() — identification and kinematics.
- \c hits(), \c points() — constituent objects.
- \c print() — print summary.

\section fmsCluster_seealso See Also

\ref page_stFmsHit "StFmsHit",
\ref page_stFmsPoint "StFmsPoint",
\ref page_stFmsPointPair "StFmsPointPair"
*/
